### REST API Requests for Posts and Comments
### Base URL: http://localhost:3000

### ============================================
### POSTS API ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### 1. Add a New Post
POST http://localhost:3000/post
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My New Post",
  "content": "This is the content of my new post",
  "sender": 1
}

### 2. Get All Posts
GET http://localhost:3000/post

### 3. Get a Post by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/post/1

### 4. Get Posts by Sender
GET http://localhost:3000/post?sender=1

### 5. Update a Post
PUT http://localhost:3000/post/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Post Title",
  "content": "Updated post content",
  "sender": 1
}

### ============================================
### COMMENTS API ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### 6. Create a New Comment
POST http://localhost:3000/comment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "This is a new comment",
  "postId": 1,
  "userId": 1
}

### 7. Get All Comments
GET http://localhost:3000/comment

### 8. Get Comment by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/comment/1

### 9. Get Comments by Post ID
GET http://localhost:3000/comment?post=1

### 10. Update a Comment
PUT http://localhost:3000/comment/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Updated comment content",
  "userId": 1
}

### 11. Delete a Comment
DELETE http://localhost:3000/comment/1

### ============================================
### ROOT ENDPOINT
### ============================================

### Get API Information
GET http://localhost:3000/

